# Physical fulfillment

One order gets one dispense command.

- Authorize fulfillment only after a verified payment.
- If the command was accepted but not verified, read the record again. Do not send another command.
- If the dispenser rejects the command before accepting it, a retry or a refund is allowed.
- Record the evidence on the order.

```ts
const previous = issued.get(command.idempotencyKey);
if (previous) return { ...previous, duplicate: true };
```

Do not call a lock, motor, or heater through this path. The simulated locker is not a physical lock.
